# .gitleaksignore for IntVue
# Format: GITLEAKS_ID:<path>:<tag>
# This prevents false positives on test data, example credentials, and hardcoded safe values

# Test data — mock credentials and example values in unit tests
**/Tests/**:*:test-credentials
**/Tests/**:*:mock-password
**/Tests/**:*:example-key

# Documentation — code examples in README/docs
**/README.md:*:code-example
**/*.md:*:sample-credentials

# Configuration templates — .env.example, appsettings.example.json
**.example.*:*:example-config
**/appsettings.*.json:*:example-credentials

